    {"id": "dnssec-013", "why": "A Bogus chain with CD off decides nothing: the walk is skipped, the answer is SERVFAIL, and the Block rule on the target is not applied (review L2-F18)", "endpoint": "e-cn-bypassdef", "client": "",
