    {"id": "dnssec-015", "why": "Rebind on, a Bogus answer with a private address and CD off: SERVFAIL, not a Rebind block. The forger must not choose the outcome or trigger a Grant (5.11)", "endpoint": "e-opt-rebind", "client": "",
